{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 19: business accounts won by a sales team and lost to churn. The sales team doubles at month 12; new reps take time to become productive. }
Base Reps=
	10
	~	rep
	~	Sales reps before the expansion.
	|
Added Reps=
	10
	~	rep
	~	Reps added at the expansion.
	|
Expansion Month=
	12
	~	month
	~	When the new reps join.
	|
Sales Reps=
	Base Reps + STEP(Added Reps, Expansion Month)
	~	rep
	~	Reps on the payroll.
	|
Ramp Time=
	4
	~	month
	~	Average time for a new rep to reach full productivity.
	|
Effective Reps=
	SMOOTH(Sales Reps, Ramp Time)
	~	rep
	~	Reps at full productivity equivalent.
	|
Rep Productivity=
	3
	~	accounts/rep/month
	~	Accounts won per fully productive rep per month.
	|
Acquisitions=
	Effective Reps * Rep Productivity
	~	accounts/month
	~	Accounts won per month.
	|
Churn Fraction=
	0.05
	~	1/month
	~	Share of accounts lost per month.
	|
Churn=
	Accounts * Churn Fraction
	~	accounts/month
	~	Accounts lost per month.
	|
Accounts= INTEG(
	Acquisitions - Churn,
	Acquisitions / Churn Fraction)
	~	accounts
	~	Active business accounts; starts in balance.
	|
Accounts Data Table(
	[(1,0)-(48,2000)],(1,594.4),(2,614.9),(3,606.2),(4,590.7),(5,610.1),(6,578.2),(7,608.9),(8,591.6),(9,609.5),(10,606.6),(11,588.5),(12,607.9),(13,608.2),(14,602.1),(15,654.8),(16,652.7),(17,640.8),(18,662.8),(19,702.2),(20,722.2),(21,726.8),(22,775.9),(23,778.7),(24,783.3),(25,809.2),(26,830.0),(27,826.6),(28,853.9),(29,855.1),(30,893.1),(31,921.2),(32,906.6),(33,944.0),(34,934.0),(35,961.4),(36,967.5),(37,968.0),(38,988.4),(39,988.2),(40,1020.4),(41,1025.7),(42,1051.5),(43,1019.7),(44,1065.8),(45,1055.6),(46,1069.8),(47,1067.6),(48,1099.9))
	~	accounts
	~	Observed accounts at each month end (synthetic history, seed 19).
	|
Accounts Data=
	Accounts Data Table(Time)
	~	accounts
	~	Observed accounts, interpolated between month ends.
	|
Fit Weight=
	STEP(1, 1)
	~	dmnl
	~	Counts error only from the first observation onwards.
	|
Squared Error Rate=
	Fit Weight * (Accounts - Accounts Data) ^ 2 / Error Period
	~	accounts*accounts/month
	~	Squared gap between model and data, spread over each month.
	|
Error Period=
	1
	~	month
	~	The interval between observations.
	|
Fit Error= INTEG(
	Squared Error Rate,
	0)
	~	accounts*accounts
	~	Accumulated squared error: the objective to minimise.
	|
********************************************************
	.Control
********************************************************~
		Simulation Control Parameters
	|
FINAL TIME  = 48
	~	month
	~	The final time for the simulation.
	|
INITIAL TIME  = 0
	~	month
	~	The initial time for the simulation.
	|
SAVEPER  = 
        TIME STEP
	~	month [0,?]
	~	The frequency with which output is stored.
	|
TIME STEP  = 0.125
	~	month [0,?]
	~	The time step for the simulation.
	|
